OL,3,GNEWSA'Patience tested' over RAF
OL,4,AFairford communication
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for better official
OL,7,Fcommunication with people living near
OL,8,FRAF Fairford, following issues which
OL,9,Fshe said had "tested everybody's
OL,10,Fpatience".
OL,12,FMore than 80 homes in the village of
OL,13,FWhelford were evacuated in September
OL,14,Fafter a major incident was declared
OL,15,Fnear the airbase. Two British nationals
OL,16,Fappeared in court on Tuesday in
OL,17,Fconnection with an alleged Iran-linked
OL,18,Fplot.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
