OL,3,GNEWSA'Patience tested' over RAF
OL,4,AFairford communication
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Roz Savage, MP for South Cotswolds,
OL,7,Fsaid she has asked the government for
OL,8,Finformation about a number of issues,
OL,9,Fincluding whether US bombers would
OL,10,Freturn to the base.
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Defence has declined to
OL,13,Fcomment.
